  <section class="wk-page profile-page"><div class="profile-page__head"><div><h1>个人中心</h1><p>个人资料和第三方连接器</p></div><t-button theme="primary" @click="save"><template #icon><t-icon name="check" /></template>保存修改</t-button></div><div class="profile-layout"><div class="wk-settings-group"><div class="wk-setting-row wk-setting-row--profile"><div class="wk-profile-avatar">{{ profile.avatar }}</div><div class="wk-setting-info"><h2>个人资料</h2><p>昵称和头像仅用于你的私人工作台。</p></div><div class="wk-setting-control wk-profile-fields"><t-input v-model="profile.nickname" placeholder="昵称" /><t-input v-model="profile.avatar" maxlength="2" placeholder="头像文字（1-2 个字）" /><t-input v-model="profile.email" type="email" placeholder="邮箱" /></div></div><div class="wk-setting-row"><div class="wk-setting-info"><label>登录方式</label><p>当前仅支持邮箱和密码登录。</p></div><div class="wk-setting-control"><span class="wk-info-value">{{ profile.email }}</span></div></div><div class="wk-setting-row"><div class="wk-setting-info"><label>数据可见性</label><p>采集数据只允许本人查看，管理员默认不能查看私人数据。</p></div><div class="wk-setting-control"><t-tag theme="success" variant="light"><t-icon name="lock-on" /> 仅本人可见</t-tag></div></div></div><div class="wk-settings-group"><div class="wk-settings-group__title"><h2>连接器</h2><p>授权后开放对应知识库。一个外部账号只能绑定一个系统用户。</p></div><div v-for="source in sources" :key="source.key" class="wk-setting-row"><div class="wk-connector-icon" :style="{ background: sourceColor[source.key] }">{{ source.name.slice(0, 1) }}</div><div class="wk-setting-info"><label>{{ source.name }}</label><p>{{ source.bound ? source.account : '未绑定，绑定后可选择群聊并持续采集' }}</p></div><div class="wk-setting-control"><t-tag v-if="source.bound" theme="success" variant="light">已授权</t-tag><t-button :theme="source.bound ? 'default' : 'primary'" :variant="source.bound ? 'outline' : 'base'" size="small" @click="toggle(source)">{{ source.bound ? '解除绑定' : '绑定' }}</t-button></div></div></div></div></section>
